OL,3,GNEWSA'Beauty of human art' celebrated
OL,4,Aat comic festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "beauty of human art" has been
OL,7,Fcelebrated at Thought Bubble, with the
OL,8,Fcomic art festival celebrating its 20th
OL,9,Fanniversary.
OL,11,FThousands of people headed to Harrogate
OL,12,Ffor the event over the weekend, with
OL,13,Fmany dressed as their favourite
OL,14,Fcharacters in vibrant costumes.
OL,16,FAttendees praised it for shining a
OL,17,Fspotlight on "unique small artists",
OL,18,Fwith more than 600 creators showcasing
OL,19,Ftheir work at the town's convention
OL,20,Fcentre.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
