OL,3,GNEWSA'Beauty of human art' celebrated
OL,4,Aat comic festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the rising use of artificial
OL,7,Fintelligence (AI), graphic novelists at
OL,8,Fthe event said celebrating human-made
OL,9,Fart was "imperative".
